# FixProof — Environment Variable Configuration
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to '.env' in your project directory: cp .env.example .env
# 2. Replace the placeholder values below with your own valid credentials.
# 3. NEVER commit your actual '.env' file or any real secrets to Git.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Google AI / Gemini API Key ---
# Required only for the ADK agent (agent.py). The core engine and tests
# work without any API key.
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_google_api_key_here

# --- Model Settings ---
# Model identifier used by the ADK agent. Defaults to gemini-3.5-flash-lite.
# FIXPROOF_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash-lite
